## 🎨 Prompts para Generación de Imágenes (Batch 5 - Burger Menu)

He utilizado un prefijo `b01_`, `b02_`, etc., para que los títulos sean únicos y no entren en conflicto con las descargas de Sushi y Tapas. Al descargar el ZIP, solo busca los archivos que empiecen por "b".

*Instrucciones del Generador:* Usa formato 4:3 (o Cuadrado), "Fotografía Gastronómica Estilo FoodPorn, iluminación contrastada, colores vibrantes, hiperrealismo".

| Identificador Recomendado | Título / Elemento a Generar | Prompt para la IA (Inglés recomendado para Midjourney/DALL-E) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **b01_entrantes_fries** | Loaded Bacon Cheese Fries | *Foodporn close-up photography of curly fries loaded with dripping melted yellow cheddar cheese and crispy dark bacon bits. Dark background, dramatic neon lighting, hyper-detailed, 8k.* |
| **b02_entrantes_wings** | Spicy Buffalo Wings | *Macro food photography of crispy fried chicken wings dripping with bright red spicy buffalo sauce, served with a side of white ranch dip. Dark cinematic lighting, glossy sauce, ultra-realistic.* |
| **b03_entrantes_tequenos** | Tequeños Venezolanos | *Close-up of golden fried puff pastry cheese sticks (tequeños). One is broken in half showing stringy, stretchy melted white cheese. Professional food styling, dark moody background.* |
| **b04_entrantes_nachos** | Nachos Volcán Pulled Pork | *Epic mountain of yellow corn tortilla chips topped with juicy pulled pork, bright green jalapeños, and drizzles of white sour cream. High contrast, neon rim lighting, sharp focus.* |
| **b05_smash_single** | Classic Single Smash | *Perfect single smash burger on a shiny brioche bun, ultra-crispy lacy meat crust, dripping melted yellow American cheese, pickles. Fast food editorial style, dark background, 8k resolution.* |
| **b06_smash_double** | Bacon Double Smash | *Massive double smash burger with a crispy dark meat crust, two layers of melting American cheese, and thick cuts of smoky bacon hanging out. Dripping grease, hyper-realistic food photography.* |
| **b07_smash_oklahoma** | Oklahoma Fried Onion | *Oklahoma style smash burger with paper-thin white onions smashed into the crispy beef patty, melted cheese, soft potato bun. Cinematic dark lighting, food magazine cover.* |
| **b08_smash_chicken** | Crispy Chicken Sandwich | *Southern fried crispy chicken sandwich in a bun with creamy white coleslaw spilling out. Golden crunchy texture on the chicken, highly detailed, dramatic lighting.* |
| **b09_smash_truffle** | Triple Truffle Smash Beast | *Monstrous triple smash burger with melting white havarti cheese, dark caramelized onions, and dripping black truffle mayo. Gourmet fast food, moody dark studio lighting, 8k.* |
| **b10_smash_provolone** | La Ingobernable Provolone | *Smash burger featuring a massive deep-fried, breaded provolone cheese disc on top of the beef, with liquid cheese oozing out of the crispy breading. Hyper-detailed, mouth-watering.* |
| **b11_smash_veggie** | Veggie Beyond Smash | *Delicious plant-based smash burger looking exactly like real beef, with melting vegan cheese and fresh green lettuce. High-end fast food photography, vibrant colors.* |
| **b12_smash_maccheese** | Mac & Cheese Fat Burger | *Over-the-top burger topped with a huge scoop of bright yellow gooey macaroni and cheese spilling over the beef patty. Extreme foodporn, sharp focus, 8k.* |
| **b13_pizza_bufala** | Margherita di Bufala | *Authentic Neapolitan pizza, blistered leopard-spotted crust, bright red San Marzano tomato sauce, pools of melted white bufala mozzarella, fresh green basil leaves. Overhead dark moody shot.* |
| **b14_pizza_detroit** | Detroit Spicy Pepperoni | *Detroit style thick square pizza, crispy caramelized cheese edges, topped with small pepperoni cups holding tiny pools of bright red oil. Extreme close-up, hyper-realistic food photography.* |
| **b15_pizza_trufa** | Pizza Bianca Trufada | *White pizza (pizza bianca) with creamy ricotta base, roasted wild mushrooms, and slices of black truffle. Elegant dark lighting, gourmet pizzeria style, highly detailed.* |
| **b16_pizza_bbq** | Barbacoa Pulled Pork Sweet | *Pizza generously topped with shiny sticky BBQ pulled pork, melted gouda cheese, and purple red onion rings. High contrast, dripping sauce, ultra-realistic.* |
| **b17_salsa_crave** | Tarrina Salsa Secreta | *Macro shot of a small black tub filled with orange creamy secret burger sauce with visible bits of pickle relish. Studio lighting, sharp focus.* |
| **b18_salsa_trufa** | Extra Mayo Trufada Oscura | *Macro shot of a small tub of dense white mayonnaise mixed with specks of dark black truffle paste. Gourmet sauce photography.* |
| **b19_salsa_cheddar** | Bañera de Cheddar Líquido | *A large cup overflowing with hot, bright yellow liquid melted cheddar cheese. Extremely glossy, foodporn style.* |
| **b20_salsa_miel** | Sirope Miel Extra Picante | *Close-up of golden honey infused with red chili flakes pouring smoothly into a small black dish. Backlit, glowing amber color, 8k.* |
| **b21_postre_shake** | Mega Shake Oreo Monster | *Massive milkshake in a tall glass, thick vanilla ice cream blended with black oreo cookies, topped with a mountain of whipped cream and oreo crumbles. Dark background, neon rim light.* |
| **b22_postre_biscoff** | Tarta de Queso Lotus | *Slice of creamy cheesecake with a thick layer of melted caramel Biscoff Lotus spread dripping down the side, on a crushed cookie base. Dramatic dark food photography.* |
| **b23_postre_brownie** | Brownie Volcánico | *Dark chocolate brownie square served in a mini black cast iron skillet, with a molten chocolate center oozing out. Steaming hot, hyper-detailed, 8k.* |
| **b24_postre_helado** | Helado Soft Cremoso | *Perfect swirl of creamy vanilla soft-serve ice cream in a classic cup. High contrast lighting, smooth texture, professional ice cream photography.* |
| **b25_bebida_limonada** | Limonada Rosa Artesana | *A frosty glass of pink raspberry lemonade full of ice cubes and fresh raspberries, covered in condensation. Dark background, refreshing, hyper-realistic.* |
